    "updated_at": "2023-02-16T03:55:09Z",
    "body": "Chromium bubbles both toggle and beforetoggle events I think: https://source.chromium.org/search?q=ToggleEvent::createBubble&ss=chromium\r\n\r\nI think bubbling for popovers can be useful. I could see a webapp with lots of menus/context menus modes that would want to have a single event listener for all of them. I don't have a strong preference though.",
