    "updated_at": "2023-02-17T16:32:11Z",
    "body": "It would be very confusing if some toggle events did bubble but some didn't. And that would likely also break sites which use details elements.\r\nToggle event was discussed also in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/1533",
    "author_association": "NONE",
